    "evidence_text": "Shikashika is a shaved ice drink made from glacier ice in Peru and Bolivia.\n\nFinding Kraftland\n\nFinding Kraftland is a 2006 independent documentary from Richard Kraft productions starring Stacey J. Aswad, Richard Kraft, and Nicky Kraft.\n\nZooper Dooper\n\nZooper Doopers are a type of frozen iceblock treat, popular in Australia.\n\n Zooper Doopers are somewhat of a cultural icon and have been popular since they first appeared in 1971.\n\n They are produced and owned by the Daily Drinks Company.\n\nDairy mix\n\nA dairy mix is the blend of milk, cream, sugar, stabilizers, and vanilla packaged by a dairy for commercial use.\n\n This mix can either be made directly into ice cream or placed into containers for the use in soft serve, frozen custard, or ice cream machines.\n\n Dairy mix used in restaurants can be also used to make frozen drinks or smoothies.\n\nWei-Chuan Food Corporation\n\nWei Chuan Foods () is a Taiwan-based manufacturer of Chinese condiments, canned goods, drinks, and frozen goods.\n\n Its more popular, widely recognized products include canned pickles, soy sauce and oyster sauces, and frozen dumplings and wontons.",
